<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ibico - Garçom para Evento Corporativo</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>

    <!-- HEADER -->
    <header class="header">
        <div class="header__inner">
            <div class="logo">Ibico</div>
            <nav class="nav">
                <a href="#" class="nav__link nav__link--active">Inicio</a>
                <a href="#" class="nav__link">Carteirah</a>
                <a href="#" class="nav__link">Historico</a>
            </nav>
            <div class="header__actions">
                <button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Notificações">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <path d="M18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9" />
                        <path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.46 0" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
                <button class="icon-btn" aria-label="Perfil">
                    <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
                        stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                        <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
                        <path d="M6.5 19c1-3 3.2-4.5 5.5-4.5s4.5 1.5 5.5 4.5" />
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero__inner">
            <div class="hero__main">
                <span class="badge">Oportunidade Disponível</span>
                <h1 class="hero__title">Garçom para Evento Corporativo - Lançamento Tecnológico</h1>
                <div class="hero__meta">
                    <span class="meta-item">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" />
                        </svg>
                        Duração: 6 Horas
                    </span>
                    <span class="meta-item">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
                        </svg>
                        Empresa Verificada
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero__price">
                <span class="hero__price-label">Valor da diária</span>
                <span class="hero__price-value">R$ 280,00</span>
                <span class="hero__price-sub">Pagamento imediato via PIX</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTENT -->
    <main class="content">
        <div class="content__grid">

            <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
            <div class="content__left">

                <section class="card">
                    <h2 class="card__title">Descrição do Serviço</h2>
                    <p class="description">
                        Buscamos garçons profissionais e ágeis para atuar em um evento de lançamento de produto no Setor
                        de Inovação. O profissional será responsável pelo serviço de finger foods e bebidas (espumante e
                        água) durante o coquetel de abertura.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="checklist">
                        <li>
                            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                            Exige-se traje social completo (calça preta, camisa branca e gravata borboleta preta).
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                            Experiência prévia em eventos de alto padrão será um diferencial.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                            Pontualidade é fundamental: chegar 30 minutos antes para o briefing.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </section>

                <section class="info-box">
                    <div class="info-box__col">
                        <div class="info-box__heading">
                            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" />
                                <line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6" />
                                <line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6" />
                                <line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10" />
                            </svg>
                            Data do Job
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-box__value">25 de Outubro, 2024</div>
                        <div class="info-box__sub">Sexta-feira</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-box__col">
                        <div class="info-box__heading">
                            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" />
                            </svg>
                            Horário
                        </div>
                        <div class="info-box__value">18:00 — 00:00</div>
                        <div class="info-box__sub">Total de 6 horas previstas</div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="location">
                    <h2 class="card__title">Localização</h2>
                    <div class="location__card">
                        <div class="location__pin">
                            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" />
                                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div class="location__text">
                            <strong>Innovation Hub Sudeste</strong>
                            <span>Av. das Nações, 4500 - Prédio B, Vila Olímpia</span>
                        </div>
                        <a href="#" class="location__link">
                            Ver no Google Maps
                            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6" />
                                <polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9" />
                                <line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3" />
                            </svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="location__map" aria-hidden="true"></div>
                </section>

            </div>

            <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
            <aside class="content__right">
                <div class="summary-card">
                    <h3 class="summary-card__title">Resumo do Bico</h3>

                    <div class="summary-row">
                        <span>Vagas abertas</span>
                        <strong>2 de 5</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-row">
                        <span>Classificação exigida</span>
                        <strong class="rating">★ 4.5+</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="summary-row">
                        <span>Status</span>
                        <strong class="status"><span class="status-dot"></span>Imediato</strong>
                    </div>

                    <button class="btn-accept" type="button">
                        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                            <path d="M13 2 3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7l1-8z" />
                        </svg>
                        Aceitar Bico
                    </button>
                    <p class="summary-card__disclaimer">
                        Ao aceitar, você concorda com os Termos de Serviço e a Política de Cancelamento.
                    </p>

                    <hr class="summary-card__divider">

                    <div class="poster">
                        <span class="poster__label">Postado por:</span>
                        <div class="poster__profile">
                            <div class="poster__avatar"></div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="poster__name">Prime Eventos S.A.</div>
                                <div class="poster__count">128 bicos realizados</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="side-actions">
                    <button class="btn-secondary" type="button">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3" />
                            <circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3" />
                            <circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3" />
                            <line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49" />
                            <line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49" />
                        </svg>
                        Compartilhar
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-secondary" type="button">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12" />
                            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16" />
                        </svg>
                        Denunciar
                    </button>
                </div>
            </aside>

        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer__inner">
            <div class="footer__brand">
                <div class="logo logo--footer">Ibico</div>
                <p>© 2024 Ibico Intermediação Ltda.</p>
                <p>Inspirado na clareza da Araponga.</p>
            </div>
            <nav class="footer__links">
                <a href="#">Termos</a>
                <a href="#">Privacidade</a>
                <a href="#">Suporte</a>
                <a href="#">Trabalhe Conosco</a>
            </nav>
            <div class="footer__globes">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                    <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" />
                    <path
                        d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
                </svg>
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                    <line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" />
                    <path
                        d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>

</html>